c
c Minor-Mercury is an adapted version of original Mercury package to handle
c N-body integrations in the irregular gravity field around a minor body, such
c an Asteroid and a Comet.
c Additionally, this package also works for single (original), binary (close/wide)
c and triple (S(AB)-P) star systems.
c
